---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="The Full LGBTQ+ Tulum Guidebook | Queerness Experiences" description={"The full LGBTQ+ Tulum guidebook for queer and trans travelers. 3-4 days of curated recommendations for food, cenotes, safety, and getting around, written by someone who actually lives here."}>

<section class="guide" id="guide" style="border-top:none;">
  <div class="guide-inner">
    <p class="sec-eye" style="color:var(--yellow);">The full guidebook</p>
    <h1>3-4 days of Tulum,<br><span class="accent">already planned for you.</span></h1>
    <p class="guide-lead">You already saw a taste of what I recommend, free. The full guidebook is the whole thing: a real day-by-day plan for your trip, written by someone who actually lives here.</p>
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <img src="/images/santi-red-juice-bomba.jpg" alt="Santi smiling with a fresh watermelon juice at Bomba Snack in Tulum" style="object-position:center 15%;">
      <img src="/images/santi-aperol-spritz.jpg" alt="Santi smiling with a drink at a cafe in Tulum" style="object-position:center 20%;">
      <img src="/images/santi-fan-cafe-coffee.jpg" alt="Santi holding an iced coffee at Story Horse cafe in Tulum">
      <img src="/images/story-horse-group-coffee.jpg" alt="Santi and a friend sharing coffee and food at a cafe table in Tulum" style="object-position:center 30%;">
    </div>
    <div class="guide-box">
      <ul class="ginc">
        <li>A full 3-4 day plan: what to do, in what order, so you're not wasting time figuring it out</li>
        <li>Every place I actually send friends to: food, coffee, a queer-friendly bar, and more</li>
        <li>The getting-around and money stuff that saves you real money (no Uber, the ATM trick, and more)</li>
        <li>Direct email access. If you have a question before or during your trip, I'll answer it myself</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="gb-price">$27</div>
      <a href="https://queernessexperiences.gumroad.com/l/lgbtq-tulum-guide" class="btn-p" style="text-align:center;">Get the Full Guidebook →</a>
      <div class="gstat">Questions before you buy? Email <a href="mailto:info@queernessexperiences.com" style="color:var(--magenta);font-weight:700;">info@queernessexperiences.com</a>. I'll help you figure out if it's right for your trip.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background:var(--bone);padding:var(--s-lg) var(--s-sm);text-align:center;">
  <p style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--dark);">You're about to have an incredible trip in Tulum. This is everything I'd tell you myself if we were already friends, so you don't miss a thing.</p>
</section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .gb-price{font-family:var(--ff);font-size:32px;color:var(--magenta);text-align:center;margin-bottom:14px;text-transform:uppercase;}
</style>
